    <string name="guide_1">"Beka izandla zilingane namahlombe. Yehlisa isifuba siye phansi, ugcine umzimba uqonde nezindololwane zigobe, bese uziphusha uye phezulu."</string>
    <string name="guide_2">"Yima izinyawo zilingane namahlombe. Gobisa amadolo wehlise izinqe sengathi uhlala esihlalweni, gcina isifuba siphezulu, bese uyasukuma."</string>
    <string name="guide_3">"Beka izingalo phansi, izindololwane ngaphansi kwamahlombe. Gcina umzimba uqonde kusukela ekhanda kuya ezithendeni, uqinise isisu."</string>
    <string name="guide_4">"Qala usesimweni sokuphusha umzimba ngezandla. Donsela idolo ngalinye esifubeni ngokushintshana, njengokugijima."</string>
    <string name="guide_5">"Thatha igxathu eliya phambili. Gobisa amadolo womabili aze abe seduze nama-degree angu-90, ugcine umzimba uqonde, bese ubuyela emuva."</string>
    <string name="guide_6">"Gobisa amadolo, gxumisa izinyawo emuva usesimweni sokuphusha umzimba, yenza ukuphusha okukodwa, ubuyise izinyawo, bese ugxumela phezulu."</string>
    <string name="guide_7">"Yima uqonde nezindololwane eduze komzimba. Gobisa izingalo uphakamise izinsimbi, uqinise imisipha, bese wehlisa kancane."</string>
    <string name="guide_8">"Gobela phambili ezinqulwini ugcine umhlane uqonde. Donsela izinsimbi okhalweni nezindololwane eduze nomzimba, bese wehlisa."</string>
    <string name="guide_9">"Yima uqonde nezinsimbi emaceleni. Phakamisa izingalo emaceleni kuze zilingane namahlombe, ugobise izindololwane kancane, bese wehlisa."</string>
    <string name="guide_10">"Guqa ngezandla namadolo. Donsa umoya ugobise umhlane ubheke phezulu, bese ukhipha umoya ugobise umhlane ubheke esifubeni."</string>
    <string name="guide_11">"Kusukela ezandleni nasemadolweni, phakamisa izinqe wenze u-V obheke phansi. Cindezela izithende phansi, uphumuze ikhanda."</string>
    <string name="guide_12">"Lala ngesisu, ubeke izandla ngaphansi kwamahlombe. Phusha kancane uphakamise isifuba, ugcine izinqe phansi."</string>
    <string name="guide_13">"Lala ebhentshini ubambe insimbi ngezandla ezivuleke ngaphezu kwamahlombe. Yehlisa insimbi esifubeni ngokucophelela, bese uyiphusha phezulu."</string>
    <string name="guide_14">"Yima izinyawo ngaphansi kwensimbi. Gobela ezinqulwini uyibambe, gcina umhlane uqonde nesifuba siphezulu, bese uyasukuma usebenzisa imilenze nezinqe."</string>
